# tests/drive.rs adds Inbox/Stray.md (an orphan), Inbox/stray.png (unused) and Empty/Deeper/ (an
# empty folder). Tidy lists them; the orphan and the image go to the trash together after one
# prompt, u brings both back, then they go again for tests/drive.rs to find in the sandbox trash.
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace 35 notes
keys T
wait-for Orphans: no links in or out · 2
expect • Inbox/Loose thought.md
expect • Inbox/Stray.md
expect Unused attachments · 1
expect ▫ Inbox/stray.png
expect Empty folders · 1
expect ▤ Empty/
expect Unresolved links · 3
expect ? Lahar
expect ← Volcanoes/Mount St. Helens:12
screen
keys a
wait-for Notes nothing links to · 
keys a
wait-for Orphans: no links in or out · 2
keys down space space
wait-for Tidy · 2 marked
expect ✓ • Inbox/Stray.md
expect ✓ ▫ Inbox/stray.png
keys d
wait-for Delete 2 marked items?
expect ✕ Inbox/Stray
expect ✕ Inbox/stray.png
expect They go to the system trash.
keys y
wait-for deleted 2 items · u undo
wait-for Orphans: no links in or out · 1
expect Unused attachments · 0
expect-not Inbox/Stray.md
expect Empty folders · 1
screen
keys u
wait-for restored 2 items
wait-for Orphans: no links in or out · 2
expect ▫ Inbox/stray.png
expect-not Tidy · 2 marked
keys home down space space d
wait-for Delete 2 marked items?
keys y
wait-for deleted 2 items · u undo
wait-for Unused attachments · 0
keys esc
wait-gone Unused attachments
keys q
exits 0
